  "post_content": "<p>Con un concierto en el auditorio de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda a cargo de los alumnos se ha clausurado la tarde de este domingo el I Curso de improvisaci&oacute;n y jazz para vibrafonistas, dirigido por Dani Catal&aacute;n.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/04/IMG_6603.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Durante s&aacute;bado y domingo, los percusionistas m&aacute;s j&oacute;venes han podido convivir con otros ya mucho m&aacute;s experimentados como Eloi Puertas L&oacute;pez, Sisco Clemente Castell&oacute;, Javi Red&oacute;n o el propio Dani Catal&aacute;n, que les ha mostrado a todos los secretos de la improvisaci&oacute;n del jazz para vibrafonistas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6577.jpg\" alt=\"img_6577\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6579.jpg\" alt=\"img_6579\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6580.jpg\" alt=\"img_6580\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6581.jpg\" alt=\"img_6581\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6582.jpg\" alt=\"img_6582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6583.jpg\" alt=\"img_6583\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6584.jpg\" alt=\"img_6584\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6603.jpg\" alt=\"img_6603\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6604.jpg\" alt=\"img_6604\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6605.jpg\" alt=\"img_6605\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6606.jpg\" alt=\"img_6606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6607.jpg\" alt=\"img_6607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6608.jpg\" alt=\"img_6608\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6609.jpg\" alt=\"img_6609\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6610.jpg\" alt=\"img_6610\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6611.jpg\" alt=\"img_6611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6612.jpg\" alt=\"img_6612\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/img_6613.jpg\" alt=\"img_6613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/cursimprovisaciovibrafonistesonda/i